
---

## 4. Step-by-step: Publish to GitHub

### A. Create the repository on GitHub
1. Go to [https://github.com/new](https://github.com/new)
2. Repository name: `AttendanceSheet` (or `Attendance-Sheet-Management-System`)
3. Description: `JavaFX Attendance Sheet Management System – Data Structures Final Project`
4. Set to **Public**
5. **Do NOT** check “Add a README” (we will push our own)
6. Click **Create repository**

### B. Push from your computer (PowerShell / Terminal)

```powershell
# 1. Go to your project folder
cd "C:\Users\User\Desktop\Array\AttendanceSheet"

# 2. Initialize git (if not already)
git init

# 3. Add all files
git add .

# 4. First commit
git commit -m "Initial commit: Attendance Sheet Management System (JavaFX + FXML)"

# 5. Rename branch to main
git branch -M main

# 6. Connect to your GitHub repo (replace YOUR_USERNAME)
git remote add origin https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/AttendanceSheet.git

# 7. Push
git push -u origin main
